      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE LOCKETT (1) ran below best last time finishing fourth (31.20) over 530m at Angle Park from Box 5. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with three wins from four starts. Should bounce back. URANA SPACE (5) jumped from box 1 last time and ran away with an impressive win scoring by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 39.31. Has a tricky draw to overcome and will need a clean break. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Can make it two on the bounce. SECRETS WE KEEP (7) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 6 lengths into second (39.74) at this track in a Other over 680m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Leading player again. BING BING PERIL (3) should be thereabouts.",
